  "aboutDmxPainterMulticastUniverse": "MULTICAST\nUniverso U",
  "aboutDmxPainterRx": "RX",
  "aboutDmxPainterIgmpNote": "Sin IGMP: flood\nCon IGMP: sólo puertos suscritos",
